(ii) The original petitioners are at liberty to apply for the withdrawal of the said amount, which application shall be considered by the concerned District Judge, on its own merits and after hearing all parties concerned, appropriate orders shall be passed;
https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis (iii) The present appellant may also seek further orders on the stay petition before the learned District Judge;
